C1: In NavigateDirectlyToLoginCallbackRestartsLoginWithoutInteropFailure, window.__msalSignInCalled only becomes true after an authorization-code exchange through the new RemoteMsalAuthenticationStartup token endpoint completes, so that endpoint's response determines whether the test's sign-in assertion succeeds.
